{"id":"9a59657cbfef22b5","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-function.md","title":"Function","display":"df-function — Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-function","aliases":["57-df-function"],"display":"df-function — Function","depends_on":["[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]","[[57-df-arity]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-function — Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b55affe36ee4719a\" href=\"?note=b55affe36ee4719a\" title=\"57-df-arity\">57-df-arity</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Func}_n(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Func}_n(S)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ar}\">\\(\\mathrm{ar}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b55affe36ee4719a\" href=\"?note=b55affe36ee4719a\" title=\"57-df-arity\">57-df-arity</a>。此处 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Func}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Func}(S)\\)</span> 是正元函数符号集合，不是集合函数类。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Func}(S)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\ge1}\\mathrm{Func}_n(S).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Func}(S)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\ge1}\\mathrm{Func}_n(S).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>只凭元数大于零不能区分函数符号与关系符号；现在显式使用已有类别分量。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-symbol-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"d43696a63788f3df","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-arity","status":"resolved","id":"b55affe36ee4719a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-arity]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-symbol-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"d43696a63788f3df","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S$ 及 $\\mathrm{Func}_n(S)$ 见 [[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]；$\\mathrm{ar}$ 见 [[57-df-arity]]。此处 $\\mathrm{Func}(S)$ 是正元函数符号集合，不是集合函数类。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-arity","status":"resolved","id":"b55affe36ee4719a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S$ 及 $\\mathrm{Func}_n(S)$ 见 [[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]；$\\mathrm{ar}$ 见 [[57-df-arity]]。此处 $\\mathrm{Func}(S)$ 是正元函数符号集合，不是集合函数类。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Func}_n(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ar}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Func}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Func}(S)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\ge1}\\mathrm{Func}_n(S).","display":true}],"bytes":635,"backlinks":[{"id":"4829220d0330e683","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ 为 [[57-df-first-order-language]] 的字母表；$I=\\mathrm{Func}(S)$ 取 [[57-df-function]]，只含正元函数符号；$n_i=\\mathrm{arity}(i)$ 取 [[57-df-arity]]。\n$F$ 是候选抽象载体，$g$ 是定义域为 $I$ 的候选运算族，$\\mathfrak F_S=\\langle F,g\\rangle$；不预设 $F=\\mathrm{Fml}_S$。$\\mathrm{FV}$ 是显式固定的候选支持映射，其定义域包含当前候选载体且 $\\mathrm{FV}(p)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}$；$F\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S$ 时采用 [[57-df-free-variable]] 的映射。该支持映射为本谓词的固定环境参数。$f_i^{\\mathfrak F}$ 和 $|\\mathfrak F_S|$ 使用下式的相应投影接口。"},{"id":"cb21c77571b2da10","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$、$n\\ge1$、$f\\in S$；符号分量、元数与函数符号集合分别见 [[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]、[[57-df-arity]]、[[57-df-function]]。"},{"id":"c136ba3960a7223a","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 $S$ 的全部非逻辑符号分量，见 [[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]、[[57-df-arity]]、[[57-df-constant]]、[[57-df-function]]。"},{"id":"32441a1c772cdc39","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\forall n \\geq 1\\;\\forall f \\in \\mathrm{Func}_n\\;\\forall t_1, \\ldots, t_n \\in \\mathrm{Term}_S\\;(P(t_1) \\land \\cdots \\land P(t_n) \\to P(f\\,t_1\\,\\ldots\\,t_n))$ (函数符号兼容, see [[57-df-function]])"},{"id":"672b43fc6a891c3a","anchor":"ref-88","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原 56、58 的依赖保持既有内部落点；本次仅补齐输入中未提供的 88、90 依赖并转入 57，全部当前依赖均在本册内部。关系定义域迁入 [[57-df-relation-domain]]，集合函数迁入 [[57-df-set-function]]，不覆盖 [[57-df-domain]]、[[57-df-function]] 的既有对象。"},{"id":"ca4dd8b012648fba","anchor":"ref-79","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-Lomega1omega]]\n[[57-df-S-ar]]\n[[57-df-SequentCalculus]]\n[[57-df-W-e]]\n[[57-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[57-df-acf]]\n[[57-df-arith0]]\n[[57-df-arithmetic-hierarchy]]\n[[57-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]]\n[[57-df-arity]]\n[[57-df-assignment]]\n[[57-df-atomic-formula]]\n[[57-df-axiom-rule]]\n[[57-df-axiom-sequent]]\n[[57-df-back-and-forth]]\n[[57-df-beta-function]]\n[[57-df-boolean-algebra]]\n[[57-df-bound-variable]]\n[[57-df-cardinal]]\n[[57-df-clause]]\n[[57-df-clause-set]]\n[[57-df-closed-world-assumption]]\n[[57-df-closure-operator]]\n[[57-df-cnf]]\n[[57-df-compactness-property]]\n[[57-df-conjunction-left]]\n